  "prefLabel": "Rev 506.06 Value Added Products",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 506.06 Value Added Products. Earth that is used by the owner in the production of asphalt, concrete, or other construction products shall be taxable in the year in which the earth was extracted from its state of natural repose.\n\nSource. #9926, eff 5-18-11; ss by #12834, eff 7-25-19",
